{"t":"Edron Dragon Lair","s":"edron-dragon-lair-8bad1","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Dragon_Lord_c599c2.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Edron Dragon Lair</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Dragon Lord\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Lord_c599c2.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">North of <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33098,31701,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33098, 31701, 7)</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocation\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation(s)</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">All vocations.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Level &amp; Skills' Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvlknights\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"> <div class=\"skills-box\"> <h3 class=\"skills-box-header\"><span class=\"mw-headlin