ht=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-245× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Ham\">Dragon Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Mushroom\">Green Mushroom</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Book%20%28Gemmed%29\">Book (Gemmed)</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× Royal Spear (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-7× <a href=\"#/wiki/Power%20Bolt\">Power Bolt</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Ring\">Energy Ring</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Sapphire\">Small Sapphire</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Mug\">Golden Mug</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Dragon%20Scale\">Red Dragon Scale</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Dragon%20Leather\">Red Dragon Leather</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Crystal\">Life Crystal</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Strange Helmet (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Sword\">Fire Sword</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Royal%20Helmet\">Royal Helmet</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tower%20Shield\">Tower Shield</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Scale%20Mail\">Dragon Scale Mail</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord%20Trophy\">Dragon Lord Trophy</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Slayer\">Dragon Slayer</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["fire-axe-quest"]}